Package: merraRshare
Type: Package
Title: Share R Results as a Single Self-Contained HTML Page
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("CRMG Ltd", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maj8merra@gmail.com")
Description: Turns plots, maps, tables and notes made in R into one
    self-contained HTML file that opens by double-clicking, can be emailed
    or uploaded to a website, and keeps interactive zoom, hover and table
    search. Includes an RStudio addin ("Share results") so no code is needed.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    htmltools,
    base64enc,
    shiny,
    utils,
    tools
Suggests:
    ggplot2,
    plotly,
    DT,
    leaflet,
    rstudioapi
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
